<title>JAPAN: Toyota seeking NYSE listing by 2000 - president.</title>
<headline>Toyota seeking NYSE listing by 2000 - president.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp president Hiroshi Okuda said that he hopes to list his company's shares on the New York stock exchange by the year 2000.</p>
<p>He said Toyota had already cleared financial requirements for the listing but some problems remained in the public relations area. He did not elaborate.</p>
<p>&quot;Our target is to be listed as early as 2000,&quot; Okuda told reporters.</p>
</text>
